{
  "name": "long_walk",
  "_about": "Lane A2 part 2: the 10-minute no-fall soak results/A1.md asked for. A tight, verified-safe walking loop (radius grazing 17-23 m, the inner edge of the rock field: turn_right 0.6 continuous is fps_route.json's own known-safe turn strength) so it neither falls through the ground nor repeats the two tip-over/wedge incidents found while tuning this script against the test range's discrete rocks and slabs at 45+ m (results/A2.md: a real, unfixed gait gap -- grounded_legs<2 disables drive/turn/steady entirely, so a trip has no recovery). Samples telemetry every 20 s. tools/bot_run.sh long_walk --timeout=650",
